WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:00.959
(Chuckles)
(Clapping)

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:01.835
♪♪

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.378
(Wall rolling)

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.379
(Struggles)
-Ahh!

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.006
Good luck to us both.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.467
(Phone vibrates)

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:09.801
(Gasps)
-Oh!

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.761
(Door opens)

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:11.762
(Door closes)

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:13.722
♪♪

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:16.391
Sam:
I've blamed bad luck for
everything that's gone wrong in my life.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.894
♪♪

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:21.647
You sure have bad luck, Sam
Greenfield.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:22.689
Ugh!

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.107
Sam:
Take that, universe!

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:25.525
Whoa!
-(Shelf crashes down)

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:26.985
Marvin:
Ow!

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:27.986
Sam:
Until

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.072
♪♪

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:32.991
Sam:
I found an actual lucky penny!

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.534
♪♪

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.369
Ah!

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:36.161
(Whack)

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.205
Sam:
Something that could finally
turn my life around.

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:39.164
♪♪

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.874
Sam:
Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.501
And what did I do?

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:43.794
(Gasps)

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:45.003
Sam:
I flushed it down the toilet.

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:48.173
(Toilet flushes)

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:50.259
You flushed my penny down the
toilet?

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:51.843
(Gasps)

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.512
You just...talked.

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.638
(Gasps)

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:55.639
Wait!

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:56.765
I just need another penny!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.141
Whoa!

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:04.564
♪♪

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.565
Sam:
Whoa!

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.400
♪♪

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.527
Always with the obnoxiously long
password!

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:13.031
♪♪

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:13.615
Sam:
Ah!

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.325
♪♪

00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:15.909
Bob:
Screams!

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:18.161
Bob:
Humans cannot be here!

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:18.954
-Where's here?

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.747
Bob:
The land of luck.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.834
I'll leave as soon as you give
me another lucky penny.

00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:25.252
Bob:
You best start blendin' in. 

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:27.170
Hello.
-Ah!

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.257
Mighty leprechaun fraulein!

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:31.216
Well done, nature!

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:33.885
Gerry:
This is where good luck is born.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:35.512
Sam:
A dragon?

00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:38.473
Gerry:
She's the only creature that can
sniff out bad luck.

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:40.225
There's bad luck here, too?

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.059
Good luck on top,

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:41.852
Gerry:
bad luck on the bottom.

00:01:41.852 --> 00:01:43.061
♪♪

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.522
The tiniest amount of bad luck

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:47.858
Dragon:
can shut down our entire
operation.

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:48.275
(Thud)

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:49.192
Leprechaun:
Mhmm.

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:51.570
Just how unlucky are you?

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.279
(Step breaks)
-Ahh!

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:53.071
Ow!

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:53.572
Oh no!

00:01:53.572 --> 00:01:54.406
Ah!

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:55.532
(Bell dings)

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.074
(Bell thud)
Ugh!

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.909
Super, duper unlucky.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:59.119
You cause a disaster!

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.162
Sam:
-Ow!
Bob:  -Ugh!

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:03.373
Dragon:
The good luck connection has
been severed.

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:04.666
♪♪

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.669
Sam:
I doomed you and everyone else
to a life of bad luck.

00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:09.046
Sam;
We need to fix this.

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:10.172
Ahh!

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:11.548
Bad luck ogre:
What are you doing here?

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:12.049
(Smack)
-Ow!

00:02:12.049 --> 00:02:12.466
Ahh!

00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:13.467
-No!
Ow!

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:14.634
♪♪

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.135
Ow!

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:16.595
Good luck to us both.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.513
♪♪

00:02:18.513 --> 00:02:19.514
What about Jeff?

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.809
(Speaking German)

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:24.686
I have no words.

